annotations:
  artifacthub.io/changes: |-
    - kind: changed
      description: "Updated the edge image to v4.10.2. Access-Control-Allow-Origin now echoes a single matching origin instead of the whole cors_allowed_origin list, which browsers reject. With no CORS setting the edge leaves the origin's CORS headers alone, and preflight-only headers stay on preflights."
    - kind: changed
      description: "Client disconnects before Varnish answers are recorded as status 499 (client_closed) instead of an upstream 503 in the response metrics and access log."
